58:## Providers
59-
60:`Provider` is the application provider. Nested Providers are always scoped, even with
61:`scoped={false}`, and inherit unspecified theme, language, layout, and component-default settings.
62-Mobile settings use independent defaults. Use a feature provider to configure just one feature. All listed components and prop types are exported from `@gravity-ui/uikit`.
63-
64:### Provider
65-
66:`ProviderProps` combines the theme props below, `lang` and `fallbackLang`, the mobile props below,
67-`children`, and these settings:
68-
69-| Prop           | Type                                    | Behavior                                                   |
70-| -------------- | --------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
71:| `layout`       | `Omit<LayoutProviderProps, 'children'>` | Layout configuration and media queries                     |
72-| `defaultProps` | `DefaultPropsMap`                       | Component defaults; explicit component props take priority |
73-
