91:Read the requested theme with `useTheme`, the resolved theme with `useThemeValue`, system mappings
92-with `useThemeSettings`, and direction with `useDirection`. Change theme by updating the provider's
93:`theme` prop. See [Scoped themes](#scoped-themes) for local overrides.
94-
95:### LangProvider
96-
97:`LangProviderProps` accepts `children`, `lang`, and `fallbackLang`. Language names support built-in
98-`en` and `ru` as well as custom languages registered through the i18n API. Nested providers inherit
99-unspecified options. When either language option is specified without a parent language context,
100-the remaining option defaults to `en`. With neither option, the provider passes through the parent
101-context, or `useLang` reads the global `configure` settings when there is no parent context.
102-
103-```tsx
